<title>USA: Reno Air names B.J. Rone CFO.</title>
<headline>Reno Air names B.J. Rone CFO.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reno Air Inc said Friday it named B.J. Rone as senior vice president, finance and administration and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Rone joins Reno Air from JHM Executive Alliance, a management consulting firm, the company said.</p>
<p>It could not immediately be learned if the position was new.</p>
